/*  A rabbit's chase is given to an outer name.
    Broken: no rule named a chase at all. See docs/SOUNDNESS.md.  */

Pull a book on collections.
    Define letters as a chase.
    Pull a rabbit.
        Define own as a chase.
        Insert "abcd" into own.
        The letters becomes own.
    Done.

    /*  Make and drop enough values that freed memory is handed out again. */
    Define churn as a series of text.
    Define tick as 0.
    While tick is less than 400, repeat:
        Insert ("zzzzzzzz" joined to "yyyyyyyy") into churn.
        The tick becomes tick + 1.
    Done.
    State letters converted to text.
Done.
